     * | - | - | - |
     * | Yes | Yes | Return the [`Auth`](https://clerk.com/docs/reference/backend/types/auth-object) object. |
     * | Yes | No | Return a `404` error. |
     * | No | No | Redirect the user to the sign-in page\*. |
